# Secrets — defensive patterns. None should ever land in this repo (judge
# tokens live in ~/.config/secrets/keys.env, which is out-of-tree). These
# patterns catch accidents before they happen.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
id_rsa
id_ed25519
credentials*
secrets*
